  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n, karanl\u0131k ve ayd\u0131nl\u0131k b\xF6l\xFCmler olmak \xFCzere
    ikiye ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015F. Bu iki k\u0131s\u0131m aras\u0131nda telvelerden
    olu\u015Fan bir ge\xE7it g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Yakla\u015F\u0131k {{sayi,2,14}} ayd\u0131r
    senin bu ge\xE7idin i\xE7inde oldu\u011Funu hissediyorum Say\u0131n {{isim}}.
    Gerek akraba ve tan\u0131d\u0131klar\u0131nla, gerekse yak\u0131n arkada\u015Flar\u0131nla
    \"\u015Fer\" sand\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z baz\u0131 olaylar ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015F,
    maddi s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar \xE7ekmi\u015Fsin. E\u015Fin {{data, cinsiyet=erkek,
    han\u0131mefendinin | cinsiyet=kad\u0131n, beyefendinin}} de bir hayli \xFCz\xFCld\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC
    hissetti\u011Fim bu sorunlar\u0131n, \xE7ok yak\u0131nda seni b\xFCy\xFCk bir
    \"hayra\" ula\u015Ft\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6recek, meselelerin
    i\xE7 y\xFCz\xFCne fehmedeceksin."
